REMARK 280 CRYSTALLIZATION CONDITIONS: MES 50MM PH6.0, PEG MME 550 32% AT       
REMARK 280  285K. THE PROTEIN WAS CONCENTRATED AT 2 MG/ML IN MES-NAOH PH        
REMARK 280  6.00 (20 MM), DTT (5 MM) AND MIXED WITH AN EQUAL VOLUME OF THE      
REMARK 280  RESERVOIR SOLUTION CONTAINING PEG MME 550 (32%), MES PH 6.00 (40    
REMARK 280  MM), DTT (5 MM). CRYSTAL SIZE (300X40X40 MICROM3) IN 20MICROL       
REMARK 280  SITTING DROPS. MANGANESE DERIVATIVE WAS OBTAINED BY SOAKING FOR     
REMARK 280  24 HOURS. PROTEIN CRYSTALS IN THE RESERVOIR SOLUTION WERE           
REMARK 280  SUPPLEMENTED WITH 20 MM MNCL2 (PH 6.00).CRYSTALS WERE FROZEN IN     
REMARK 280  LIQUID PROPANE AFTER SOAKING FOR A FEW SECONDS IN PEG MME 550       
REMARK 280  (50%), MES PH 6.00 (40 MM)., VAPOR DIFFUSION, HANGING OR SITTING-   
REMARK 280  DROP                                                                
